+          "It tells what the person had, or had not, experienced before this moment of the story."
         ]
       ]
     },
     {
       "type": "examples",
-      "title": "Ejemplos literarios",
+      "title": "In a story",
       "items": [
         {
-          "spanish": "Muchos años antes, su abuelo le había advertido sobre los peligros del páramo.",
-          "english": "Many years before, his grandfather had warned him about the dangers of the wasteland."
