+      "title": "Setting the speed of a story",
+      "content": "You know *cuando* and *mientras* from A2 Unit 13, *en cuanto* with the subjunctive from A2 Unit 27 and *a medida que* from B1 Unit 2. In a story, connectors also set the speed. *Apenas* and *en cuanto* make the second event follow the first at once. *Al cabo de* skips a stretch of time. *A medida que* and *conforme* show two things changing together, little by little. In a story about the past, all of them take the indicative."
     },
     {
       "type": "table",
-      "title": "Conectores narrativos en el pasado",
+      "title": "Fast, skipped and gradual",
       "rows": [
